# Paths Semgrep skips (CI: .github/workflows/security.yml).
#
# Having this file REPLACES Semgrep's built-in ignore list, which skips
# tests/ and more. We want tests/ and plugins/ scanned, so only vendored,
# generated and local-only paths are excluded here. To silence a single
# false positive, use an inline `# nosemgrep: <rule-id> -- <reason>` instead
# of adding a path.

# Vendored / generated JS and Python packaging output.
node_modules/
*.egg-info/

# Local environments, caches and build output.
.venv/
venv/
build/
dist/
reports/

# Local SQLite dev DB and logs, never committed intentionally but present
# in some checkouts.
mcp.db
*.log
